      "comment": "The judge agrees the claim is true: an 1845 birth predates all Pennsylvania registration. \"The 1870, 1880 and 1900 censuses (pli_007)\" is accurate; one plan item covers those three censuses. Both required not_reached entries are present and correct.\n"
